  "notes": "Friendly early-tier client (proposal) supporting the Captain's early-game counter-terror loop: the mindanao_sulu theatre (fictional Mindanao/Sulu-inspired jungle islands and towns) hosts ISIS-affiliated cells (real-world: Dawlah Islamiyah and Abu Sayyaf remnants, mapped to faction 'isis'). The separate south_china_sea theatre covers the grey-zone confrontation with Chinese maritime forces (water cannon, ramming; real 2023-25 incidents at Second Thomas Shoal and Scarborough Shoal). Job 7 (Captain, 2026-10-10): the Mindanao counter-terror loop now has its own early-game theatre, mindanao_sulu (Mindanao/Sulu-inspired jungle islands and coast; isis East Asia cells, usa advisers), so south_china_sea stays a grey-zone maritime map.",
